	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the process of Account payable, which starts with a copy of a workbook for internal records.
After filing a copy for internal documents, a receiving report should be created.
After a receiving report is created, the next tasks should be to collect the receiving report and doubling check a three-way match, they should be done in parallel.
Once all pre-tasks are completed then the storing of the paid invoice file needs to be done.
The process is now completed.
